ar standing in for an occurrence signal fails in both directions: beer_hall trades when the calendar says closed (0.172), Ellel does not trade when it says open (0.798). Fix: derive Mondrian groups from observed trading, not the weekday."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_drift_decomposition", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_ellel_drift", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/74_DU6_ellel_drift_result.md", "source_location": "lines 8-10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_composition_candidate", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_false_open_days", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/74_DU6_ellel_drift_result.md", "source_location": "lines 24-38", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_dispersion_candidate", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_ellel_drift", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/74_DU6_ellel_drift_result.md", "source_location": "line 20", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_tail_candidate", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_composition_candidate", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "brain/log/74_DU6_ellel_drift_result.md", "source_location": "lines 35-38", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_false_open_days", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_du3_missing_occurrence_signal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/74_DU6_ellel_drift_result.md", "source_location": "lines 58-68", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_ellel_drift", "target": "brain_log_74_du6_ellel_drift_result_du6", "relation": "ref